{"video_id":"nABVTFBmV2M","title":"Lessons Learned Orchestrating Multi-Tenant GPUs on OpenShift AI with NVIDIA KAI (G/H2... Luca Berton","conference":"kubecon","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":2551,"segments":[{"start":0.8,"duration":3.84,"text":"Welcome everybody."},{"start":2.76,"duration":5.64,"text":"Today I want to share a practical"},{"start":4.64,"duration":8.16,"text":"blueprint of running multi-tenant GPUs"},{"start":8.4,"duration":7.6,"text":"on bare metal OpenShift AI delivering"},{"start":12.8,"duration":5.72,"text":"a sovereign full-stack AI platform that"},{"start":16.0,"duration":5.96,"text":"drives immediate result."},{"start":18.52,"duration":5.96,"text":"The key point is this. Getting GPUs to"},{"start":21.96,"duration":5.88,"text":"run is not the hard part."},{"start":24.48,"duration":8.0,"text":"The hard part is sharing them safely,"},{"start":27.84,"duration":4.64,"text":"fairly, and efficiently across teams."},{"start":40.12,"duration":5.68,"text":"My name is Luca Berton."},{"start":42.12,"duration":5.76,"text":"I work on AI-ready infrastructure and"},{"start":45.8,"duration":5.36,"text":"enterprise cloud"},{"start":47.88,"duration":7.16,"text":"environments at Dell Consulting. And"},{"start":51.16,"duration":7.32,"text":"these tools come from hands-on practical"},{"start":55.04,"duration":6.8,"text":"platform work delivering to an avionics"},{"start":58.48,"duration":6.28,"text":"customer in France in production today."},{"start":61.84,"duration":7.76,"text":"What I will show you is the result of"},{"start":64.76,"duration":4.84,"text":"operational lessons from real systems."},{"start":71.64,"duration":3.0,"text":"You're here for the architectural"},{"start":73.56,"duration":3.16,"text":"overview."},{"start":74.64,"duration":3.6,"text":"And this is based on the Dell AI"},{"start":76.72,"duration":5.16,"text":"factory."},{"start":78.24,"duration":8.04,"text":"This was a bare metal environment"},{"start":81.88,"duration":7.12,"text":"layered on Red Hat Kubernetes OpenShift."},{"start":86.28,"duration":7.0,"text":"OpenShift AI will then capsule all the"},{"start":89.0,"duration":7.12,"text":"best project that drive AI innovation."},{"start":93.28,"duration":6.32,"text":"Oh, I forgot to tell you. All the slide"},{"start":96.12,"duration":5.24,"text":"are available throughout this QR code,"},{"start":99.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"but I will show you also at the end of"},{"start":101.36,"duration":3.24,"text":"the presentation."},{"start":105.08,"duration":3.4,"text":"Where was I?"},{"start":106.68,"duration":4.08,"text":"Okay."},{"start":108.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"OpenShift AI is the component that"},{"start":110.76,"duration":7.0,"text":"encapsulate all the"},{"start":113.92,"duration":5.76,"text":"open source project related to AI."},{"start":117.76,"duration":4.68,"text":"But other two components are very"},{"start":119.68,"duration":6.32,"text":"important. Nvidia GPU and network"},{"start":122.44,"duration":4.64,"text":"operator, and as well having good GPUs."},{"start":126.0,"duration":3.88,"text":"In this"},{"start":127.08,"duration":6.96,"text":"for this customer we use a Grasshopper"},{"start":129.88,"duration":6.36,"text":"H200 GPU nodes with more than 137"},{"start":134.04,"duration":3.28,"text":"gigabyte"},{"start":136.24,"duration":2.68,"text":"each."},{"start":137.32,"duration":5.2,"text":"And we're"},{"start":138.92,"duration":5.24,"text":"leveraging the latest Dell AI server"},{"start":142.52,"duration":7.36,"text":"that can"},{"start":144.16,"duration":7.2,"text":"manage up to eight GPU card per node."},{"start":149.88,"duration":6.48,"text":"Uh"},{"start":151.36,"duration":5.0,"text":"Another challenge was RDMA for storage."},{"start":156.6,"duration":6.04,"text":"And another small thing, this is"},{"start":159.12,"duration":5.32,"text":"air-gapped setup with local mirrors."},{"start":162.64,"duration":3.88,"text":"In the cloud some complexity is"},{"start":164.44,"duration":6.24,"text":"abstracted away."},{"start":166.52,"duration":6.52,"text":"Here every layer is our to own,"},{"start":170.68,"duration":5.08,"text":"configure, and recover."},{"start":173.04,"duration":5.36,"text":"In total we installed more than 2 TB of"},{"start":175.76,"duration":4.68,"text":"data downloading all the intricacy of"},{"start":178.4,"duration":4.68,"text":"dependency between all the various"},{"start":180.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"component."},{"start":183.08,"duration":4.88,"text":"Uh"},{"start":184.92,"duration":5.08,"text":"What we learned at very quickly that a"},{"start":187.96,"duration":4.44,"text":"working GPU cluster"},{"start":190.0,"duration":3.84,"text":"is not the same as a shareable GPU"},{"start":192.4,"duration":5.4,"text":"platform."},{"start":193.84,"duration":7.2,"text":"The real risk were noisy neighbor,"},{"start":197.8,"duration":6.08,"text":"queue starvation, mismatched"},{"start":201.04,"duration":6.2,"text":"MIG behavior. Enough familiar with MIG"},{"start":203.88,"duration":6.16,"text":"is a way of slicing GPU in predefined"},{"start":207.24,"duration":5.72,"text":"way, like a half, quarter, and so on and"},{"start":210.04,"duration":5.56,"text":"so forth. You can divide by the tensor"},{"start":212.96,"duration":4.32,"text":"core or the GPU memory."},{"start":215.6,"duration":3.0,"text":"And there are some already provided"},{"start":217.28,"duration":4.36,"text":"profile."},{"start":218.6,"duration":6.24,"text":"Driver drift is also another"},{"start":221.64,"duration":7.04,"text":"problem, especially because this doesn't"},{"start":224.84,"duration":6.88,"text":"allow a core here"},{"start":228.68,"duration":5.4,"text":"visibility across the cluster."},{"start":231.72,"duration":5.2,"text":"Um"},{"start":234.08,"duration":5.4,"text":"Networking failures around SR-IOV and"},{"start":236.92,"duration":4.6,"text":"RDMA, I would say that were the most"},{"start":239.48,"duration":3.72,"text":"interesting thing part of the project"},{"start":241.52,"duration":4.32,"text":"that"},{"start":243.2,"duration":5.16,"text":"require a little bit of more love."},{"start":245.84,"duration":7.12,"text":"The challenge become how do we prevent"},{"start":248.36,"duration":4.6,"text":"chaos before tenants ever feel it?"},{"start":253.84,"duration":4.92,"text":"We use a framework."},{"start":256.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"Every platform decision had to pass"},{"start":258.76,"duration":3.92,"text":"through three lenses."},{"start":261.24,"duration":4.92,"text":"First,"},{"start":262.68,"duration":5.4,"text":"safe, meaning one team cannot break"},{"start":266.16,"duration":3.08,"text":"another."},{"start":268.08,"duration":2.24,"text":"Second,"},{"start":269.24,"duration":4.44,"text":"fair,"},{"start":270.32,"duration":6.44,"text":"meaning contention is deterministic, not"},{"start":273.68,"duration":5.48,"text":"political, and nobody can override the"},{"start":276.76,"duration":6.44,"text":"decision on another team."},{"start":279.16,"duration":7.48,"text":"Third, efficient, meaning we optimize"},{"start":283.2,"duration":6.72,"text":"for useful outcomes per GPU hours, not"},{"start":286.64,"duration":5.48,"text":"just utilization graphs."},{"start":289.92,"duration":6.16,"text":"Remember these three lenses. These will"},{"start":292.12,"duration":8.52,"text":"be a guideline for all the presentation."},{"start":296.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"Safety, fairness, and efficiency."},{"start":300.68,"duration":4.84,"text":"We design"},{"start":302.24,"duration":6.8,"text":"for three personas"},{"start":305.52,"duration":6.72,"text":"for a full service delivery. The end"},{"start":309.04,"duration":4.56,"text":"user want a fast access and stable"},{"start":312.24,"duration":5.04,"text":"latency."},{"start":313.6,"duration":6.2,"text":"The LLM ops teams want repeatable"},{"start":317.28,"duration":4.68,"text":"deployments, safe upgrades, and"},{"start":319.8,"duration":4.0,"text":"observability."},{"start":321.96,"duration":3.4,"text":"The tenant admin"},{"start":323.8,"duration":4.48,"text":"tenant admin"},{"start":325.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"wants boundaries and visibility into"},{"start":328.28,"duration":5.56,"text":"cost."},{"start":329.68,"duration":7.6,"text":"If any of those persona loses, platform"},{"start":333.84,"duration":3.44,"text":"adoption collapses."},{"start":338.0,"duration":6.68,"text":"Our answers was GitOps."},{"start":341.08,"duration":6.0,"text":"Argo CD and Kustomize become the single"},{"start":344.68,"duration":4.76,"text":"source of truth for operations,"},{"start":347.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"infrastructure, and tenant configuration"},{"start":349.44,"duration":4.12,"text":"and applications."},{"start":351.16,"duration":5.24,"text":"The reason this matters"},{"start":353.56,"duration":4.88,"text":"is not just automation."},{"start":356.4,"duration":4.16,"text":"It is auditability,"},{"start":358.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"repeatability, and rollback."},{"start":360.56,"duration":5.64,"text":"In a highly regulated environment, this"},{"start":362.88,"duration":3.32,"text":"is more critical than ever."},{"start":366.76,"duration":6.0,"text":"In a multi-tenant GPU platform, manual"},{"start":369.6,"duration":7.24,"text":"fixes become future outages, and they"},{"start":372.76,"duration":6.16,"text":"can introduce single snowflake."},{"start":376.84,"duration":4.16,"text":"We work with Kubernetes for years, so"},{"start":378.92,"duration":6.52,"text":"this is the best advice that I can give"},{"start":381.0,"duration":8.4,"text":"you. We use We use a particular"},{"start":385.44,"duration":7.48,"text":"setup of a tree. We use the app over app"},{"start":389.4,"duration":5.88,"text":"of a Argo CD. But more or less this is"},{"start":392.92,"duration":3.72,"text":"the directory structure that we use all"},{"start":395.28,"duration":2.6,"text":"over."},{"start":396.64,"duration":2.88,"text":"Um"},{"start":397.88,"duration":4.68,"text":"One thing, I told you this is a"},{"start":399.52,"duration":5.32,"text":"air-gapped environment, which means that"},{"start":402.56,"duration":5.4,"text":"in the beginning it was just a bare"},{"start":404.84,"duration":6.08,"text":"metal, and we need to install the node"},{"start":407.96,"duration":4.24,"text":"using the agent ISO"},{"start":410.92,"duration":3.8,"text":"created"},{"start":412.2,"duration":5.32,"text":"for OpenShift for a specific node, which"},{"start":414.72,"duration":4.0,"text":"means specify the MAC address, specify"},{"start":417.52,"duration":4.24,"text":"the"},{"start":418.72,"duration":5.64,"text":"the path of the dev device for each"},{"start":421.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"node, because this node has a lot of"},{"start":424.36,"duration":5.32,"text":"drive, PCI Express,"},{"start":426.52,"duration":4.92,"text":"and it is it become complicated very"},{"start":429.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"quickly."},{"start":431.44,"duration":3.32,"text":"Um"},{"start":433.64,"duration":4.08,"text":"One"},{"start":434.76,"duration":5.76,"text":"Once we boot the system, we use Ansible"},{"start":437.72,"duration":5.2,"text":"for the initial handshake, especially in"},{"start":440.52,"duration":5.2,"text":"the air-gapped environment, and then"},{"start":442.92,"duration":3.96,"text":"handle control to GitOps as early as"},{"start":445.72,"duration":4.08,"text":"possible."},{"start":446.88,"duration":6.76,"text":"The goal was simple, bootstrap once,"},{"start":449.8,"duration":6.68,"text":"then let Argo CD own day two operations."},{"start":453.64,"duration":7.2,"text":"That reduced drift and makes the"},{"start":456.48,"duration":4.36,"text":"platform behavior predictable over time."},{"start":460.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"Every time we need to introduce a new"},{"start":462.8,"duration":4.84,"text":"application, a new integration with a"},{"start":465.64,"duration":4.92,"text":"a different type of component, for"},{"start":467.64,"duration":5.4,"text":"example, the level of backup, we just"},{"start":470.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"create a new application and redeploy to"},{"start":473.04,"duration":5.24,"text":"the cluster."},{"start":474.88,"duration":5.76,"text":"We use a laboratory a scale-down"},{"start":478.28,"duration":5.28,"text":"environment and then deploy to the"},{"start":480.64,"duration":2.92,"text":"customer side."},{"start":484.28,"duration":5.4,"text":"For us, safety means hard is isolation"},{"start":487.88,"duration":4.56,"text":"boundaries."},{"start":489.68,"duration":5.6,"text":"We implemented this at every level."},{"start":492.44,"duration":4.08,"text":"Namespace isolation, scoped service"},{"start":495.28,"duration":3.4,"text":"account,"},{"start":496.52,"duration":3.88,"text":"least privilege with"},{"start":498.68,"duration":4.12,"text":"a rollback,"},{"start":500.4,"duration":4.68,"text":"and integrated with the local"},{"start":502.8,"duration":4.32,"text":"active directory of the customer,"},{"start":505.08,"duration":3.56,"text":"and implemented with the deny by default"},{"start":507.12,"duration":4.6,"text":"network policies."},{"start":508.64,"duration":6.24,"text":"Both security guidance, the latest"},{"start":511.72,"duration":6.0,"text":"security integrated in OpenShift,"},{"start":514.88,"duration":4.48,"text":"as you see, quotas, limits, and"},{"start":517.72,"duration":4.28,"text":"admission checks."},{"start":519.36,"duration":5.8,"text":"The key idea is that safety is not"},{"start":522.0,"duration":5.36,"text":"something operation remember to do."},{"start":525.16,"duration":4.88,"text":"It is something the platform enforces by"},{"start":527.36,"duration":5.32,"text":"default. And here you can see all the"},{"start":530.04,"duration":5.12,"text":"different layers. Admission webhooks"},{"start":532.68,"duration":5.16,"text":"were fundamental for every for every"},{"start":535.16,"duration":2.68,"text":"component."},{"start":537.96,"duration":3.8,"text":"Each tenant"},{"start":539.4,"duration":5.2,"text":"came from a standard Kustomize build"},{"start":541.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"deployed throughout Argo CD."},{"start":544.6,"duration":5.96,"text":"That bundles include namespace"},{"start":546.48,"duration":8.0,"text":"configuration, RBAC, network policy,"},{"start":550.56,"duration":6.76,"text":"quotas, supporting networking pieces."},{"start":554.48,"duration":5.88,"text":"The practical outcome is important. No"},{"start":557.32,"duration":4.6,"text":"ticket, no manual steps, no tribal"},{"start":560.36,"duration":3.8,"text":"knowledge."},{"start":561.92,"duration":4.48,"text":"A Git pull request become a tenant"},{"start":564.16,"duration":5.08,"text":"provisioning workflow."},{"start":566.4,"duration":5.56,"text":"And this is what the customer really"},{"start":569.24,"duration":5.72,"text":"asked to improve because he's a highly"},{"start":571.96,"duration":6.36,"text":"regulated customer, so he need a"},{"start":574.96,"duration":5.8,"text":"to prove compliance that"},{"start":578.32,"duration":5.44,"text":"what is running in production is exactly"},{"start":580.76,"duration":4.0,"text":"what we were expecting."},{"start":583.76,"duration":5.44,"text":"Um"},{"start":584.76,"duration":5.48,"text":"One subtle lesson, this was a This took"},{"start":589.2,"duration":5.8,"text":"a"},{"start":590.24,"duration":5.4,"text":"couple of weeks of our delivery because"},{"start":595.0,"duration":2.72,"text":"Uh,"},{"start":595.64,"duration":4.64,"text":"learned that the bare metal force you to"},{"start":597.72,"duration":4.84,"text":"care about the actual hardware mix."},{"start":600.28,"duration":4.92,"text":"Specifically, different NICs require"},{"start":602.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"different operational model."},{"start":605.2,"duration":5.08,"text":"Uh, Nvidia um"},{"start":608.0,"duration":5.92,"text":"use this type of"},{"start":610.28,"duration":5.84,"text":"uh, network card, the Nvidia ConnectX."},{"start":613.92,"duration":4.0,"text":"Uh, this have as a version six and"},{"start":616.12,"duration":3.8,"text":"version seven."},{"start":617.92,"duration":4.64,"text":"And uh"},{"start":619.92,"duration":5.64,"text":"it's complicated because it serve as a"},{"start":622.56,"duration":5.04,"text":"like a six different network card and uh"},{"start":625.56,"duration":4.36,"text":"with different capabilities connected in"},{"start":627.6,"duration":4.16,"text":"a different way with a switch and uh"},{"start":629.92,"duration":4.68,"text":"everything was uh"},{"start":631.76,"duration":5.56,"text":"uh, need to be fast. One thing that AI"},{"start":634.6,"duration":5.72,"text":"need is a faster access to data."},{"start":637.32,"duration":5.96,"text":"Faster storage faster and we need"},{"start":640.32,"duration":5.56,"text":"we need a really millisecond access."},{"start":643.28,"duration":5.92,"text":"The Nvidia ConnectX paths were managed"},{"start":645.88,"duration":7.32,"text":"by the Nvidia network operator for RDMA"},{"start":649.2,"duration":6.24,"text":"and GPU direct compatible flows."},{"start":653.2,"duration":4.24,"text":"While other NICs paths were handled"},{"start":655.44,"duration":4.12,"text":"differently. We implemented also"},{"start":657.44,"duration":3.56,"text":"different network configuration,"},{"start":659.56,"duration":4.12,"text":"different VLAN"},{"start":661.0,"duration":4.68,"text":"and so there there is like a main"},{"start":663.68,"duration":4.48,"text":"machine network, there is a"},{"start":665.68,"duration":5.12,"text":"a different network for NFS, a different"},{"start":668.16,"duration":3.24,"text":"network for backup and each of them is"},{"start":670.8,"duration":3.64,"text":"uh"},{"start":671.4,"duration":6.08,"text":"uh, separately physically separate."},{"start":674.44,"duration":7.28,"text":"The main takeaway is do not assume that"},{"start":677.48,"duration":5.8,"text":"one network recipes fits every GPU node."},{"start":681.72,"duration":2.84,"text":"You might have a slightly different"},{"start":683.28,"duration":3.28,"text":"node."},{"start":684.56,"duration":5.88,"text":"Uh, what we discovered is that there is"},{"start":686.56,"duration":7.92,"text":"a an incompatibility between the uh"},{"start":690.44,"duration":7.04,"text":"Nvidia Mellanox ConnectX card and the"},{"start":694.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"Intel integrated in the server."},{"start":697.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"There was a"},{"start":698.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"uh, an RDMA collision at kernel level"},{"start":701.72,"duration":5.4,"text":"and we were not able to"},{"start":703.92,"duration":5.72,"text":"uh enable us SR-IOV."},{"start":707.12,"duration":5.28,"text":"We discovered hardware and we need to"},{"start":709.64,"duration":5.0,"text":"blacklist the Intel uh"},{"start":712.4,"duration":3.56,"text":"the Intel driver that was taking the"},{"start":714.64,"duration":3.4,"text":"RDMA"},{"start":715.96,"duration":3.88,"text":"um"},{"start":718.04,"duration":4.0,"text":"uh, connection with the kernel and we"},{"start":719.84,"duration":4.08,"text":"were not able to move forward with the"},{"start":722.04,"duration":3.76,"text":"project."},{"start":723.92,"duration":2.68,"text":"Uh, another things"},{"start":725.8,"duration":4.24,"text":"um"},{"start":726.6,"duration":6.52,"text":"that we did, we reduced upgrade for"},{"start":730.04,"duration":6.52,"text":"fragility by moving away from the more"},{"start":733.12,"duration":6.84,"text":"tightly coupled legacy approach toward"},{"start":736.56,"duration":4.8,"text":"open kernel module and DMA buffer. These"},{"start":739.96,"duration":2.04,"text":"are the new"},{"start":741.36,"duration":4.08,"text":"uh,"},{"start":742.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"driver designed by Nvidia and they are"},{"start":745.44,"duration":4.24,"text":"fantastic to be honest. The important"},{"start":747.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"message here is that it's not the"},{"start":749.68,"duration":5.24,"text":"terminology. It is that safer upgrade"},{"start":753.0,"duration":4.6,"text":"require reducing coupling between"},{"start":754.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"drivers, kernel dependency and data"},{"start":757.6,"duration":3.04,"text":"paths."},{"start":758.68,"duration":4.24,"text":"Previously, the previous driver was"},{"start":760.64,"duration":4.2,"text":"directly connected with uh"},{"start":762.92,"duration":5.36,"text":"uh, the Docker driver."},{"start":764.84,"duration":8.08,"text":"It it create like a a strange dependency"},{"start":768.28,"duration":6.6,"text":"graph between the network and the GPU."},{"start":772.92,"duration":4.52,"text":"And one was dependent by another"},{"start":774.88,"duration":4.36,"text":"creating like a compatibility matrix"},{"start":777.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"that we need to follow when we deploy a"},{"start":779.24,"duration":2.68,"text":"new cluster."},{"start":782.16,"duration":3.96,"text":"Um"},{"start":782.8,"duration":5.44,"text":"in shared GPU environment, fairness"},{"start":786.12,"duration":5.08,"text":"does not happen naturally."},{"start":788.24,"duration":4.88,"text":"Without a clear rule, the loudest teams"},{"start":791.2,"duration":5.24,"text":"wins."},{"start":793.12,"duration":6.04,"text":"So, we use hard tenants GPU caps"},{"start":796.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"implemented through the Nvidia Kai GPU"},{"start":799.16,"duration":4.4,"text":"orchestrator."},{"start":800.88,"duration":5.32,"text":"Uh, priority classes, explicit uh"},{"start":803.56,"duration":6.08,"text":"preemption posture scheduling constraint"},{"start":806.2,"duration":5.92,"text":"and GPU aware scheduling visibility."},{"start":809.64,"duration":5.32,"text":"The goal was simple, make resource"},{"start":812.12,"duration":4.08,"text":"contention predictable, explainable and"},{"start":814.96,"duration":3.68,"text":"intentional."},{"start":816.2,"duration":6.4,"text":"Here you can see the different priority"},{"start":818.64,"duration":5.4,"text":"level and the interactive is always uh"},{"start":822.6,"duration":4.68,"text":"the one that have"},{"start":824.04,"duration":4.68,"text":"the highest priority because a user need"},{"start":827.28,"duration":2.04,"text":"a fast"},{"start":828.72,"duration":2.88,"text":"uh"},{"start":829.32,"duration":6.56,"text":"a fast interaction. Whereas the training"},{"start":831.6,"duration":4.28,"text":"can be scheduled in a batch overnight."},{"start":836.96,"duration":4.04,"text":"We looked at efficiency as outcome per"},{"start":839.8,"duration":4.2,"text":"GPU"},{"start":841.0,"duration":6.2,"text":"per hour. That means using between time"},{"start":844.0,"duration":6.68,"text":"slicing, MIG and full GPU based on"},{"start":847.2,"duration":5.8,"text":"workload type rather than ideology."},{"start":850.68,"duration":4.8,"text":"Interactive notebook"},{"start":853.0,"duration":4.92,"text":"training and inference each behave"},{"start":855.48,"duration":5.16,"text":"differently. So, the platform has to"},{"start":857.92,"duration":5.16,"text":"optimize for real workload outcomes, not"},{"start":860.64,"duration":3.16,"text":"just maximum theoretical"},{"start":863.08,"duration":3.52,"text":"um"},{"start":863.8,"duration":2.8,"text":"utilization."},{"start":867.2,"duration":4.44,"text":"Upgrade path is taking into"},{"start":869.4,"duration":5.48,"text":"consideration because"},{"start":871.64,"duration":5.4,"text":"in AI world, everything move super fast"},{"start":874.88,"duration":4.04,"text":"and especially there is a one software"},{"start":877.04,"duration":3.8,"text":"delivery every month."},{"start":878.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"One of the most important lesson was"},{"start":880.84,"duration":3.88,"text":"that the upgrade path is not an"},{"start":882.68,"duration":3.08,"text":"appendix. This is part of the platform"},{"start":884.72,"duration":3.52,"text":"design."},{"start":885.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"So, we manage and known good"},{"start":888.24,"duration":4.48,"text":"compatibility matrix in Git"},{"start":890.52,"duration":5.44,"text":"and we use like a canary pool."},{"start":892.72,"duration":6.64,"text":"A big period usually is like 48 hour. We"},{"start":895.96,"duration":6.4,"text":"evaluate how how the platform behave and"},{"start":899.36,"duration":5.88,"text":"then we were able to to move forward on"},{"start":902.36,"duration":5.92,"text":"the next stage, validation gate and"},{"start":905.24,"duration":4.6,"text":"everything is a Git based rollback based"},{"start":908.28,"duration":3.48,"text":"on Argo CD."},{"start":909.84,"duration":4.32,"text":"So, if there is a one component that"},{"start":911.76,"duration":4.68,"text":"doesn't behave like we want"},{"start":914.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"we can always revert to a configuration"},{"start":916.44,"duration":4.36,"text":"that we know is uh"},{"start":919.12,"duration":3.6,"text":"is stable and working."},{"start":920.8,"duration":4.52,"text":"We also use this when we enable new"},{"start":922.72,"duration":4.56,"text":"feature for the GPU operator. We started"},{"start":925.32,"duration":4.48,"text":"with a minimum viable"},{"start":927.28,"duration":5.84,"text":"configuration and then we start enabling"},{"start":929.8,"duration":3.32,"text":"one feature after another."},{"start":934.84,"duration":2.28,"text":"Uh"},{"start":938.4,"duration":4.92,"text":"Make the invisible visible. We invested"},{"start":940.88,"duration":5.68,"text":"in a per tenant monitoring."},{"start":943.32,"duration":5.52,"text":"Chargeback views, scheduler report, GPU"},{"start":946.56,"duration":4.6,"text":"per hour visibility and I really believe"},{"start":948.84,"duration":4.56,"text":"that observability is one of the things"},{"start":951.16,"duration":4.6,"text":"that really stand out"},{"start":953.4,"duration":4.72,"text":"when you create a new platform. Because"},{"start":955.76,"duration":4.96,"text":"this hardware is expensive and we need a"},{"start":958.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"way that we can"},{"start":960.72,"duration":4.92,"text":"uh, verify what is what is doing and"},{"start":963.12,"duration":5.84,"text":"make sure that we can report"},{"start":965.64,"duration":6.28,"text":"to our stakeholders."},{"start":968.96,"duration":5.32,"text":"Uh, the big change was behavioral. Once"},{"start":971.92,"duration":5.0,"text":"teams can see their own usage and"},{"start":974.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"impact, they become much better platform"},{"start":976.92,"duration":4.08,"text":"citizens."},{"start":978.12,"duration":5.16,"text":"A lot of developer want to get assigned"},{"start":981.0,"duration":5.76,"text":"a GPU only for themselves, but what"},{"start":983.28,"duration":5.56,"text":"happen when they go in holiday or when"},{"start":986.76,"duration":3.12,"text":"they become uh"},{"start":988.84,"duration":2.48,"text":"uh"},{"start":989.88,"duration":3.76,"text":"when for example they have they have"},{"start":991.32,"duration":4.64,"text":"some day that they are not working."},{"start":993.64,"duration":5.76,"text":"This become part of the pool and we can"},{"start":995.96,"duration":5.4,"text":"reassign on demand."},{"start":999.4,"duration":4.84,"text":"Uh"},{"start":1001.36,"duration":4.64,"text":"Let me explain you with a one demo."},{"start":1004.24,"duration":3.4,"text":"There are three"},{"start":1006.0,"duration":3.72,"text":"different persona here."},{"start":1007.64,"duration":4.4,"text":"LLM Ops engineer."},{"start":1009.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"His goal is to deploy LLM models on"},{"start":1012.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"premise so developers can securely"},{"start":1014.44,"duration":5.76,"text":"integrate the feature into application."},{"start":1017.36,"duration":5.24,"text":"William start by identifying model on"},{"start":1020.2,"duration":5.8,"text":"Hugging Face. Here we have a Microsoft"},{"start":1022.6,"duration":5.96,"text":"fee mini for example. He logs into the"},{"start":1026.0,"duration":4.92,"text":"Red Hat OpenShift and navigate to the"},{"start":1028.56,"duration":4.4,"text":"OpenShift AI dashboard."},{"start":1030.92,"duration":5.96,"text":"After verifying the model files are"},{"start":1032.96,"duration":5.08,"text":"stored in an object storage bucket it"},{"start":1036.88,"duration":3.64,"text":"could be"},{"start":1038.04,"duration":6.24,"text":"it's just a S3 compliant."},{"start":1040.52,"duration":7.48,"text":"He configure the model deployment and he"},{"start":1044.28,"duration":7.0,"text":"set up a model server using"},{"start":1048.0,"duration":3.28,"text":"the hardware accelerator."},{"start":1051.6,"duration":3.44,"text":"So, here we can see that these are all"},{"start":1053.4,"duration":3.08,"text":"the files downloaded directly from"},{"start":1055.04,"duration":3.48,"text":"Hugging Face."},{"start":1056.48,"duration":3.44,"text":"Um it's just a"},{"start":1058.52,"duration":3.96,"text":"it's just a simple"},{"start":1059.92,"duration":4.6,"text":"deployment and here I created already"},{"start":1062.48,"duration":5.2,"text":"the model under"},{"start":1064.52,"duration":6.28,"text":"OpenShift AI. One interesting part is"},{"start":1067.68,"duration":4.56,"text":"that here we are using vLLM and we can"},{"start":1070.8,"duration":4.04,"text":"allocate the Nvidia GPU for"},{"start":1072.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"acceleration. We can decide how big is"},{"start":1074.84,"duration":4.28,"text":"the deployment model. We can decide how"},{"start":1076.52,"duration":6.4,"text":"many GPUs we wanted and once it's"},{"start":1079.12,"duration":6.36,"text":"deployed we can retrieve API endpoint"},{"start":1082.92,"duration":5.24,"text":"and review performance dashboard"},{"start":1085.48,"duration":4.72,"text":"monitoring inference benchmark. Here for"},{"start":1088.16,"duration":3.16,"text":"example inter token latency and"},{"start":1090.2,"duration":4.28,"text":"throughput"},{"start":1091.32,"duration":6.08,"text":"and OpenShift system metrics like CPU"},{"start":1094.48,"duration":2.92,"text":"and memory usage."},{"start":1108.32,"duration":3.68,"text":"And also we can correlate this over"},{"start":1110.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"time."},{"start":1112.0,"duration":3.44,"text":"So, this is the view from William that"},{"start":1114.56,"duration":4.72,"text":"is"},{"start":1115.44,"duration":5.8,"text":"our LLM Ops engineer persona."},{"start":1119.28,"duration":3.36,"text":"Another important persona"},{"start":1121.24,"duration":4.04,"text":"is the"},{"start":1122.64,"duration":4.08,"text":"Michael, the OpenShift administrator."},{"start":1125.28,"duration":4.36,"text":"His goal is to guarantee the"},{"start":1126.72,"duration":5.8,"text":"performance, availability and"},{"start":1129.64,"duration":5.32,"text":"optimal utilization of the platform's"},{"start":1132.52,"duration":4.8,"text":"GPU resources."},{"start":1134.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"Michael checks the OpenShift AI"},{"start":1137.32,"duration":6.64,"text":"dashboard to see the active model"},{"start":1140.08,"duration":6.72,"text":"deployments including the one just set"},{"start":1143.96,"duration":2.84,"text":"up by William."},{"start":1153.12,"duration":5.76,"text":"And so you can see that there is a model"},{"start":1155.92,"duration":5.24,"text":"a fee four, but there is also GPT-2 that"},{"start":1158.88,"duration":4.4,"text":"is allocated by another user. So, he has"},{"start":1161.16,"duration":5.08,"text":"visibility all over the cluster so he"},{"start":1163.28,"duration":5.36,"text":"can see where the resources are."},{"start":1166.24,"duration":5.44,"text":"He then switch to Grafana to view an"},{"start":1168.64,"duration":3.96,"text":"Nvidia DCGM dashboard."},{"start":1171.68,"duration":3.04,"text":"Here"},{"start":1172.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"he monitor detailed real time hardware"},{"start":1174.72,"duration":4.8,"text":"metrics to ensure efficient GPU scaling"},{"start":1177.6,"duration":5.16,"text":"and utilization."},{"start":1179.52,"duration":7.4,"text":"Tracking data points such as GPU power"},{"start":1182.76,"duration":7.12,"text":"usage, temperature, SM clock speed"},{"start":1186.92,"duration":3.96,"text":"memory clock and specific memory usage"},{"start":1189.88,"duration":2.96,"text":"per"},{"start":1190.88,"duration":3.76,"text":"per MIG profile."},{"start":1192.84,"duration":4.0,"text":"We can see that this cluster is pretty"},{"start":1194.64,"duration":4.72,"text":"busy."},{"start":1196.84,"duration":4.68,"text":"Mark is a Python developer."},{"start":1199.36,"duration":5.28,"text":"His goal is to access an internal"},{"start":1201.52,"duration":5.88,"text":"AI-powered coding assistant to boost"},{"start":1204.64,"duration":6.52,"text":"productivity while remaining compliant"},{"start":1207.4,"duration":3.76,"text":"with internal security policies."},{"start":1212.08,"duration":5.04,"text":"Mark works inside Visual Studio."},{"start":1215.8,"duration":2.52,"text":"Like many"},{"start":1217.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"developer."},{"start":1218.32,"duration":6.8,"text":"Install the open-source Continue AI code"},{"start":1222.12,"duration":6.04,"text":"assistant access extension and you just"},{"start":1225.12,"duration":6.36,"text":"need to edit the extension config.yaml"},{"start":1228.16,"duration":6.4,"text":"file pointing it directly to the custom"},{"start":1231.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"internal API endpoints that William"},{"start":1234.56,"duration":4.36,"text":"deployed earlier."},{"start":1236.6,"duration":6.64,"text":"Rather than a public cloud service."},{"start":1238.92,"duration":7.92,"text":"You just use endpoint and API key."},{"start":1243.24,"duration":5.68,"text":"Finally, you open a Python file."},{"start":1246.84,"duration":4.96,"text":"We're all familiar with this."},{"start":1248.92,"duration":5.56,"text":"And"},{"start":1251.8,"duration":4.92,"text":"This is just a simple sorting algorithm"},{"start":1254.48,"duration":5.52,"text":"and uses the Continue chart that is"},{"start":1256.72,"duration":6.44,"text":"alongside on the left, not on the right."},{"start":1260.0,"duration":5.88,"text":"And it can ask for like make it more"},{"start":1263.16,"duration":6.52,"text":"readable or successfully"},{"start":1265.88,"duration":3.8,"text":"generate a refined code."},{"start":1272.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"As you can see, these are the three user"},{"start":1274.56,"duration":5.08,"text":"persona that in every organization can"},{"start":1278.16,"duration":3.8,"text":"can"},{"start":1279.64,"duration":3.44,"text":"the deploy and use of this type of"},{"start":1281.96,"duration":3.12,"text":"platform."},{"start":1283.08,"duration":3.72,"text":"Now you can extend to multiple domain,"},{"start":1285.08,"duration":3.72,"text":"to multiple tenant."},{"start":1286.8,"duration":4.4,"text":"And understand the impact of a solution"},{"start":1288.8,"duration":4.08,"text":"like that."},{"start":1291.2,"duration":4.6,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":1292.88,"duration":6.64,"text":"If you take only a few things away,"},{"start":1295.8,"duration":5.28,"text":"start with GitOps first and a standard"},{"start":1299.52,"duration":4.16,"text":"tenant template."},{"start":1301.08,"duration":5.96,"text":"Those two alone remove a large amount of"},{"start":1303.68,"duration":5.76,"text":"operational pain. And then add quotas,"},{"start":1307.04,"duration":4.56,"text":"clear networking ownership, a few"},{"start":1309.44,"duration":4.92,"text":"stacks, a few stacks, useful"},{"start":1311.6,"duration":4.16,"text":"observability and an explicit upgrade"},{"start":1314.36,"duration":4.44,"text":"playbook."},{"start":1315.76,"duration":5.4,"text":"The bottom message is mature"},{"start":1318.8,"duration":6.24,"text":"shared GPU platform are built from"},{"start":1321.16,"duration":3.88,"text":"gather rays, not heroics."},{"start":1328.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"As promised, the QR code is being into"},{"start":1331.2,"duration":6.16,"text":"the full slide deck."},{"start":1333.76,"duration":6.76,"text":"Um multi-tenant GPUs on bare metal work"},{"start":1337.36,"duration":5.96,"text":"then safely is provable."},{"start":1340.52,"duration":4.32,"text":"Fairness is explicit and efficiency is"},{"start":1343.32,"duration":4.12,"text":"measured."},{"start":1344.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"In our case, GitOps was the mechanism"},{"start":1347.44,"duration":4.08,"text":"that made those principle enforceable by"},{"start":1350.0,"duration":3.9,"text":"design."},{"start":1351.52,"duration":4.4,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":1353.9,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"}]}